stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> Open: create (capacity > active count)
 [*] --> Full: create (capacity = host count = 1)
 Open --> Full: approval uses last slot / capacity reduced to count
 Full --> Open: leave / capacity increased before start
 Open --> InProgress: starts_at <= now < ends_at
 Full --> InProgress: starts_at <= now < ends_at
 InProgress --> Completed: now >= ends_at
 Open --> Cancelled: Host cancels before start
 Full --> Cancelled: Host cancels before start
 note right of Open
 Derived state; no stored state column.
 Priority: Cancelled, Completed, InProgress,
 Full (active >= capacity), otherwise Open.
 Schedule edits before start can change time boundaries.
 end note
 note right of Completed
 Reads can skip directly to Completed
 if no request occurs during InProgress.
 end note
